{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2021-09-09 08:45:00', 'title': 'BORON NITRIDE COOLING FILLERS FROM 3M USED FOR THERMAL MANAGEMENT IN ADVANCED POLYMERS', 'text': 'SAINT PAUL, MINN., SEPT. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa03M (NYSE: MMM), A LEADER IN HIGH-PERFORMANCE POLYMER ADDITIVES, HAS EXPANDED THEIR LINE OF BORON NITRIDE COOLING FILLERS APPLICABLE TO A WIDE ARRAY OF AUTOMOTIVE, ELECTRICAL AND ELECTRONIC DEVICES AND COMPONENTS.'}